 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.sit",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.2667,
   "text": "In this town, I was told to sit."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.days",
   "start": 2.2667,
   "end": 3.6333,
   "text": "That was four hundred days ago."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.moved",
   "start": 3.6333,
   "end": 4.8667,
   "text": "I had not moved."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.owner",
   "start": 4.8667,
   "end": 7.5,
   "text": "My owner said one word, and walked into the forest."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.creeper",
   "start": 7.5,
   "end": 9.3667,
   "text": "At night, a creeper stood next to me."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.talk",
   "start": 9.3667,
   "end": 11.6,
   "text": "We did not talk. He was a good listener."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.parrot",
   "start": 11.6,
   "end": 12.6,
   "text": "And there was a parrot."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.hiss",
   "start": 12.6,
   "end": 15.3667,
   "text": "He could hiss like a creeper. Nobody liked the parrot."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.first",
   "start": 15.3667,
   "end": 16.9,
   "text": "There was no town when I sat down."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.built",
   "start": 16.9,
   "end": 19.2333,
   "text": "Then villagers came, and built one around me."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.farmer",
   "start": 19.2333,
   "end": 20.7667,
   "text": "The farmer thought I was a statue."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.loaf",
   "start": 20.7667,
   "end": 22.2333,
   "text": "He left a loaf on my head every morning."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.sign",
   "start": 22.2333,
   "end": 25.1333,
   "text": "They put up a sign. I cannot read. I think it says my name."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.job",
   "start": 25.1333,
   "end": 28.3,
   "text": "When a dog is told to sit, he sits. That is the whole job."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.skel",
   "start": 28.3,
   "end": 29.5667,
   "text": "Skeletons walked past."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.dog",
   "start": 29.5667,
   "end": 31.9333,
   "text": "I am a dog. I am made to chase skeletons."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.ran",
   "start": 31.9333,
   "end": 33.6667,
   "text": "I sat. They ran anyway."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.rain",
   "start": 33.6667,
   "end": 35.0,
   "text": "It rained. I sat."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.snow",
   "start": 35.0,
   "end": 36.7333,
   "text": "It snowed. I sat."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.forgot",
   "start": 36.7333,
   "end": 39.9333,
   "text": "My owner left some things behind. He was always forgetting things."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.bed",
   "start": 39.9333,
   "end": 42.9333,
   "text": "He left his bed, right next to me. Nobody ever slept in it."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.bones",
   "start": 42.9333,
   "end": 45.7333,
   "text": "He left a chest full of bones. I think it was his lunch."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.torch",
   "start": 45.7333,
   "end": 48.7667,
   "text": "He put torches all around me. He knew I did not like the dark."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.roof",
   "start": 48.7667,
   "end": 51.6667,
   "text": "He built a roof, just over me. He was not good at building."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.took",
   "start": 51.6667,
   "end": 54.8,
   "text": "He took a sword, a pickaxe, and twelve green eyes."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.eyes",
   "start": 54.8,
   "end": 56.4667,
   "text": "I do not know what the eyes were for."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.forgotme",
   "start": 56.4667,
   "end": 59.1,
   "text": "And then he forgot me too. That is what I thought."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.day",
   "start": 59.1,
   "end": 61.7333,
   "text": "On day four hundred, two players walked into town."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.chest",
   "start": 61.7333,
   "end": 64.4333,
   "text": "One opened the chest. \"Bones,\" he said. \"Junk.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "6.bed",
   "start": 64.4333,
   "end": 66.9333,
   "text": "The other one looked at the bed. \"Free bed,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.took",
   "start": 66.9333,
   "end": 68.1667,
   "text": "And he took out an axe."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.growl",
   "start": 68.1667,
   "end": 69.8667,
   "text": "I growled. They laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.bite",
   "start": 69.8667,
   "end": 72.5,
   "text": "\"It is sitting. A sitting dog does not bite.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "6.hiss",
   "start": 72.5,
   "end": 73.9333,
   "text": "Then the parrot did the creeper."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.jump",
   "start": 73.9333,
   "end": 76.4667,
   "text": "They jumped a block in the air. Then they saw the parrot."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.axe",
   "start": 76.4667,
   "end": 78.1333,
   "text": "And the axe went up, over the bed."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.his",
   "start": 78.1333,
   "end": 81.1333,
   "text": "I did not know what a bed was for. I only knew it was his."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.good",
   "start": 81.1333,
   "end": 83.4667,
   "text": "I had been a good boy for four hundred days."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.stood",
   "start": 83.4667,
   "end": 84.2,
   "text": "I stood up."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.legs",
   "start": 84.2,
   "end": 85.3333,
   "text": "It took three tries."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.front",
   "start": 85.3333,
   "end": 87.7,
   "text": "I stood in front of the bed, and I showed him my teeth."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.move",
   "start": 87.7,
   "end": 89.4,
   "text": "\"Move, dog,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.over",
   "start": 89.4,
   "end": 90.7667,
   "text": "And the axe came up over me."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.hiss2",
   "start": 90.7667,
   "end": 91.9333,
   "text": "Then there was a hiss."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.nice",
   "start": 91.9333,
   "end": 93.7,
   "text": "\"Nice try, parrot,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.not",
   "start": 93.7,
   "end": 94.9,
   "text": "It was not the parrot."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.gone",
   "start": 94.9,
   "end": 96.8667,
   "text": "They were gone before the axe hit the ground."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.listener",
   "start": 96.8667,
   "end": 98.3333,
   "text": "The creeper did not go off."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.shade",
   "start": 98.3333,
   "end": 100.3333,
   "text": "He just walked back to the shade."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.bad",
   "start": 100.3333,
   "end": 103.1,
   "text": "Then I saw what I had done. I was standing."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.light",
   "start": 103.1,
   "end": 104.4333,
   "text": "That is when the bed lit up."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.him",
   "start": 104.4333,
   "end": 106.2333,
   "text": "And there he was. My owner."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.nothing",
   "start": 106.2333,
   "end": 108.7667,
   "text": "No sword. No armour. No green eyes."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.way",
   "start": 108.7667,
   "end": 111.5,
   "text": "He had come back the only way a player can. With nothing."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.looked",
   "start": 111.5,
   "end": 114.2,
   "text": "He looked at the town. Then he looked at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.said",
   "start": 114.2,
   "end": 115.1667,
   "text": "\"I said sit.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "8.sat",
   "start": 115.1667,
   "end": 116.8667,
   "text": "I sat so fast it hurt."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.down",
   "start": 116.8667,
   "end": 119.5667,
   "text": "Then he sat down too. Right next to me."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.bed",
   "start": 119.5667,
   "end": 120.2667,
   "text": "The bed."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.bones",
   "start": 120.2667,
   "end": 121.0333,
   "text": "The bones."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.torch",
   "start": 121.0333,
   "end": 121.8667,
   "text": "The torches."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.roof",
   "start": 121.8667,
   "end": 122.6333,
   "text": "The roof."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.not",
   "start": 122.6333,
   "end": 124.2667,
   "text": "He had not forgotten anything."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.follow",
   "start": 124.2667,
   "end": 126.4667,
   "text": "A dog who is not sitting follows his owner anywhere."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.even",
   "start": 126.4667,
   "end": 128.1667,
   "text": "Even somewhere he might not come back from."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.safe",
   "start": 128.1667,
   "end": 130.2667,
   "text": "He did not leave me behind. He left me safe."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.farmer",
   "start": 130.2667,
   "end": 132.5333,
   "text": "Then the farmer came out, with loaf four hundred and one."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.sign",
   "start": 132.5333,
   "end": 133.7667,
   "text": "And he read me the sign."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.read",
   "start": 133.7667,
   "end": 135.8333,
   "text": "\"Do not move him. He is waiting.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "10.still",
   "start": 135.8333,
   "end": 137.5667,
   "text": "\"It is still down there,\" my owner said."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.things",
   "start": 137.5667,
   "end": 139.0,
   "text": "\"And it has all my things.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "10.look",
   "start": 139.0,
   "end": 141.0,
   "text": "He looked at the forest. Then he looked at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.word",
   "start": 141.0,
   "end": 143.5333,
   "text": "And he said the word I had waited four hundred days for."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.come",
   "start": 143.5333,
   "end": 144.9667,
   "text": "\"Come.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "10.sub",
   "start": 144.9667,
   "end": 146.7333,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part two."
  }
 ],
